> northeast
Cyclops Room
This room has an exit on the northwest, and a staircase leading up.

You can see a huge cyclops here.

A huge cyclops stands before you, blocking the northern passage!

> say odysseus
The cyclops, hearing that dreaded name, panics!

The cyclops runs away in terror, revealing a hidden passage!

A passage north to the Strange Passage is now clear.

> north
Strange Passage
This is a long passage. To the south is one entrance. On the east there is an old wooden door, with a large hole in it (about cyclops sized).

> east
Living Room
This is the living room. There is a door to the east. To the west is a wooden door with strange gothic lettering, which appears to be nailed shut. A trophy case takes up one corner of the room. A large oriental rug lies to one side of the room, moved away from the trap door it once covered.

